sequenceDiagram
  participant L as Learner
  participant W as dtwiz
  participant T as Tenant
  participant K as k3d cluster
  L->>W: dtwiz install kubernetes --yes
  W->>T: DQL token check
  T-->>W: 200
  W->>K: helm install dynatrace-operator
  W->>K: kubectl apply Secret + 2 DynaKubes
  K->>T: operator: connection info, ActiveGate token
  W->>K: wait until every pod is Ready
  K-->>W: node-config-collector never Ready on k3d
